Wind gusts up to 60 km/h.\n\nWhen:\nContinuing into early this morning.\n\nAdditional information:\nFreezing rain is possible, particularly for higher terrain where temperatures may be near or just below the freezing mark.\n\nTemperatures are expected to rise as the night progresses, changing any freezing rain to rain.\n\nWind gusts up to 60 km/h are expected. Any ice build-up combined with strong winds increases the risk of broken tree branches.\n\nThere is risk of injury due to slips and falls.\n\nPlease continue to monitor alerts and forecasts issued by Environment Canada. To report severe weather, send an email to ONstorm@ec.gc.ca or post reports on social media using #ONStorm.","alert_text_fr":"La pluie vergla\u00e7ante de courte dur\u00e9e persiste.\n\nQuoi :\nBref \u00e9pisode de pluie vergla\u00e7ante rendant les surfaces glac\u00e9es et glissantes par endroits.\nRafales jusqu'\u00e0 60 km/h.\n\nQuand :\nJusque t\u00f4t ce matin.\n\nRenseignements suppl\u00e9mentaires :\nDe la pluie vergla\u00e7ante est possible, surtout sur les hauteurs, o\u00f9 les temp\u00e9ratures pourraient \u00eatre pr\u00e8s du point de cong\u00e9lation ou juste en dessous de celui-ci.\n\nLes temp\u00e9ratures devraient monter au cours de la nuit, de sorte que toute pluie vergla\u00e7ante se changera en pluie.\n\nOn pr\u00e9voit des rafales jusqu'\u00e0 60 km/h. Ensemble, une accumulation de verglas et des vents forts augmentent le risque de branches d'arbres cass\u00e9es.\n\nIl y a un risque de glissades et de chutes pouvant causer des blessures.\n\nVeuillez continuer \u00e0 surveiller les alertes et les pr\u00e9visions \u00e9mises par Environnement Canada. Pour signaler du temps violent, envoyez un courriel \u00e0 meteoON@ec.gc.ca ou publiez un message sur les r\u00e9seaux sociaux en utilisant #ONMeteo.","risk_colour_en":null,"risk_colour_fr":null,"confidence_en":null,"confidence_fr":null,"impact_en":null,"impact_fr":null,"feature_name_en":"Strathroy - Komoka - Western Middlesex County","feature_name_fr":"Strathroy - Komoka - comt\u00e9 de Middlesex Ouest","province":"ON","status_en":"ended","status_fr":"termin\u00e9","feature_id":"fea1-1162"}}],"numberMatched":275,"numberReturned":3,"links":[{"type":"application/geo+json","rel":"self","title":"This document as GeoJSON","href":"https://api.weather.gc.ca/collections/weather-alerts/items?f=json&limit=3"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"application/ld+json","title":"This document as RDF (JSON-LD)","href":"https://api.weather.gc.ca/collections/weather-alerts/items?f=jsonld&limit=3"},{"type":"text/html","rel":"alternate","title":"This document as HTML","href":"https://api.weather.gc.ca/collections/weather-alerts/items?f=html&limit=3"},{"type":"application/geo+json","rel":"next","title":"Items (next)","href":"https://api.weather.gc.ca/collections/weather-alerts/items?offset=3&limit=3"},{"type":"application/json","title":"Weather Alerts","rel":"collection","href":"https://api.weather.gc.ca/collections/weather-alerts"}],"timeStamp":"2026-11-27T09:25:20.910877Z"}